1
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:24,932
A buyer, and its agent.

2
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:26,989
I shop. I'm not trusted.

3
00:00:27,233 --> 00:00:29,841
I reach the buyer's service through fixed tools.

4
00:00:30,067 --> 00:00:31,447
I decide for the buyer.

5
00:00:31,667 --> 00:00:35,241
I check policy, keep a ledger, and seal what I approve.

6
00:00:35,467 --> 00:00:36,638
Basis Theory.

7
00:00:36,867 --> 00:00:40,206
I sign, by fixed rules, and my vault holds the key.

8
00:00:40,433 --> 00:00:42,388
I'm the merchant, across the line.

9
00:00:42,633 --> 00:00:44,901
I'm the facilitator. And this is the chain.

10
00:00:45,133 --> 00:00:46,618
I order the paper.

11
00:00:47,066 --> 00:00:48,655
I fix the price.

12
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:50,280
I ask to pay.

13
00:00:50,833 --> 00:00:54,773
402: pay 1.5 USDC to this address.

14
00:00:55,033 --> 00:00:57,354
I check the terms against policy.

15
00:00:57,600 --> 00:01:00,208
I log a one-time nonce and an expiry.

16
00:01:00,433 --> 00:01:01,866
Then I seal the intent.

17
00:01:02,133 --> 00:01:04,454
I send the sealed intent to Basis Theory.

18
00:01:04,700 --> 00:01:06,054
I check the seal,

19
00:01:06,300 --> 00:01:08,072
then my five fixed rules.

20
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:11,272
Only then does my key sign.

21
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:13,925
The signature leaves. The key stays with me.

22
00:01:14,167 --> 00:01:15,599
The signature checks out.

23
00:01:15,834 --> 00:01:17,370
I record the claim.

24
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:19,267
I verify, then submit.

25
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:22,708
The buyer's USDC moves to the merchant, and I record it.

26
00:01:22,934 --> 00:01:26,142
Settled. My receipt carries the transaction hash.

27
00:01:26,367 --> 00:01:28,321
Now, requests that should fail.

28
00:01:28,567 --> 00:01:30,992
A request names an unlisted payee.

29
00:01:31,234 --> 00:01:34,677
403. My vault stays shut. No signature exists.

30
00:01:34,900 --> 00:01:39,415
To test the signer by itself, I called it directly, with no spend service in front.

31
00:01:39,633 --> 00:01:42,789
Over the five USDC cap: 403.

32
00:01:43,033 --> 00:01:46,424
Outside the time window, another policy, a bad seal: refused.

33
00:01:49,367 --> 00:01:51,165
I pay the same order again,

34
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:53,433
and I return the same receipt.

35
00:01:53,667 --> 00:01:55,203
One order, one transfer.
